{"id": null, "n": "0951029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951029", "type": "orig", "text": "三字ハ破損ノタメ缺字デアル。タダシ，第三字ハ識ノ字デアロウ。ソシテ，ソノ上ノ二字ハ，ソノ前後ヨリ考エテ，第八デナカロウカ。󴧜"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951030", "type": "orig", "text": "識ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951031", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951031", "type": "orig", "text": "前ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951032", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951032", "type": "orig", "text": "軆ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951033", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951033", "type": "orig", "text": "二六門中トヨメルガ，シカシ二六門中デハ，ソノ意味ガ通ジナイ。ヨクミルト，二ノ上ニ虫喰ノアトガアル。三六門中トスベキデアル。󴧜"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951034", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951034", "type": "orig", "text": "受ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951035", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951035", "type": "orig", "text": "受ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951036", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951036", "type": "orig", "text": "受ト讀ム󴧛．缺字󴧚"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951037", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951037", "type": "orig", "text": "以ノ字，原文デハ虫喰ノタメ讀ミ難シ。前後ノ文ヨリ考エテ以ノ字デアロウ。󴧜。心ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951038", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951038", "type": "orig", "text": "受ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951039", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951039", "type": "orig", "text": "但ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951040", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951040", "type": "orig", "text": "太賢ノ學記ニ，コノ比量ヲヒク。󴧜"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951041", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951041", "type": "orig", "text": "但ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951042", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951042", "type": "orig", "text": "害ト讀ム󴧛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951043", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951043", "type": "orig", "text": "太賢ノ學記ニ，コレヲヒクガ，ソノ引文ハ取意デアル。七八無俱有根，非六識性故，如眼根等云云󴧜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": "0951044", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0951044", "type": "orig", "text": "但ト讀ム󴧛"}
